# No em dashes

Do not use em dashes (`—`, `&mdash;`, `&#8212;`) in UI copy, titles, toasts, tooltips, PDFs, or authored explanations.

Use a comma instead.

```
# Bad
Saved on this device — retry to sync your account

# Good
Saved on this device, retry to sync your account
```

Leave em dashes only in:
- Literary source text (passages and quoted stems)
- Visual fraction bars in the equation editor
